            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/tutor/sessions/{{sessionId}}/voice",
            "description": "Sends student voice audio.\n\nReturns in ONE response:\n- student_text\n- reply_text\n- audio_base64 (mp3)\n- audio_mime\n\nNo polling required. Can take several seconds."
